messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_dirinfo.c
Line: 617
Function: tagNameCompare
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: tagNameCompare calls strcmp(ta->field_name, tb->field_name) without NULL checks. Anonymous fields created by _TIFFCreateAnonField() have field_name == NULL. When _TIFFFindFieldByName() performs a linear search via td_lfind(), tagNameCompare can be invoked with tb->field_name == NULL, causing strcmp to dereference a NULL pointer and crash.

Source context:
